Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.85,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(328.02,17.4)}Peach Boy Dumplings
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.85,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fs21\pos(206.116,449.4)}Brought to you by: Ko-Fi.me/OrangeFlash
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you, Nobita! I'll beat you up once I find you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.65,0:00:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Same here!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.59,0:00:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did he go? Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.99,0:00:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll pulverize you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.56,0:00:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll pulverize you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.80,0:00:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.91,0:00:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Doraemon! \NDoraemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.28,0:00:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Giant and Suneo are after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.45,0:00:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What am I supposed to do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.82,0:00:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.92,0:00:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Please help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.22,0:00:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so hopeless!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.40,0:00:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Peach Boy Dumplings!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.17,0:00:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,How do I use it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.17,0:00:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Make Giant eat this!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.74,0:01:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita! You have left the door open and put your shoes untidy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.11,0:01:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to assort everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.81,0:01:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,How many times do I have to tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.85,0:01:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously! Try being obedient to your mum!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.93,0:01:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you promise to do your homework when you're home?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.81,0:01:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Sit!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.68,0:01:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn around!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.55,0:01:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Now go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.75,0:01:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Mum?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.69,0:01:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it OK to leave her like that? For how long does it's effects last?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.83,0:01:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No worries. She'll be back to normal in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.13,0:02:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,These are the dumplings which are used to...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.20,0:02:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,tame wild beasts in the 22nd century.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.17,0:02:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,When an animal is fed these dumplings...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.01,0:02:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,they start obeying commands of their tamers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.64,0:02:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoos and circuses of the 22nd century use...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.38,0:02:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,...this gadget to tame and control the wild animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.98,0:02:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough of your lecture! Please lend it to me already!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.28,0:02:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, but you must not play pranks on anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.15,0:02:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks! Now I can be in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.99,0:02:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see where Giant is!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.30,0:02:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't find him!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.87,0:02:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Found 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.11,0:02:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Have one of these dumplings each.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.09,0:02:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.02,0:02:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.14,0:03:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh,my! Welcome, Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.74,0:03:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.17,0:03:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He's inside her home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.05,0:03:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He's coming out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.35,0:03:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.09,0:03:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing really.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.22,0:03:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't we play a game, Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.66,0:03:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,it's now your turn, Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.90,0:03:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.27,0:03:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! They are still there!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.77,0:03:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.01,0:03:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.52,0:03:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.52,0:04:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,RIght!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.12,0:04:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.89,0:04:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yum!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.43,0:04:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you, Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.70,0:04:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,How terrifying! Wish I had a horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.23,0:04:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What horse?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.64,0:04:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,She must have ate one of these!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.45,0:04:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Give these to Giant and Suneo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.89,0:04:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He's here! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.69,0:04:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.96,0:04:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You're giving us dumplings? Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.64,0:04:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,There they eat it! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.48,0:04:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.92,0:05:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop, Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.35,0:05:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Crawl!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.42,0:05:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This is so much fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.46,0:05:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are we crawling on the road like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.40,0:05:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop! Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.84,0:05:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Sit down!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.64,0:05:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.31,0:05:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Circle around.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.05,0:05:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.46,0:05:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you fight with each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.34,0:06:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}, did it work well?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.78,0:06:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,As you can see...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.32,0:06:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it fun to see them like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.59,0:06:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Peach Boy Dumpling is working as I expected it to.
